e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"戎勸冏以王就第。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0253","start":253,"end":254,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"八王亂時域，冏引語之孤/戎引語之公屬冏，卿是冏對戎；兩王群指顒與穎但不拆單代詞。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0256","start":256,"end":258,"surface":"葛旟","kind":"person","person_id":"t29_ix9_yor","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"八王亂時域，冏引語之孤/戎引語之公屬冏，卿是冏對戎；兩王群指顒與穎但不拆單代詞。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0267","start":267,"end":269,"surface":"王公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"葛旟泛論王公，不單指冏。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0276","start":276,"end":278,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"泛論王公家屬，非明確新增配偶子女。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0293","start":293,"end":294,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"ehx_cqg_nfx_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"八王亂時域，冏引語之孤/戎引語之公屬冏，卿是冏對戎；兩王群指顒與穎但不拆單代詞。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":82,"last_line":82,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003","text":"冏於是輔政，居攸故宮，置掾屬四十人。大築第館，北取五穀市，南開諸署，毀壞廬舍以百數，使大匠營制，與西宮等。鑿千秋門牆以通西閣，後房施鐘懸，前庭舞八佾，沈於酒色，不入朝見。坐拜百官，符敕三臺，選舉不均，惟寵親昵。以車騎將軍何勖領中領軍。封葛𣄣為牟平公，路秀小黃公，衛毅陰平公，劉真安鄉公，韓泰封丘公，號曰「五公」，委以心膂。殿中御史桓豹奏事，不先經冏府，即考竟之。於是朝廷側目，海內失望矣。南陽處士鄭方露版極諫，主簿王豹屢有箴規，冏並不能用，遂奏豹殺之。有白頭公入大司馬府大呼，言有兵起，不出甲子旬。即收殺之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0058","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0059","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"攸","kind":"person","person_id":"cac_ca2_008","status":"contextual_provisional","reso